OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust accused of failing to
OL,4,Ainvestigate deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the north-west of England's
OL,7,Fbiggest healthcare trusts has responded
OL,8,Fto allegations it failed to properly
OL,9,Finvestigate claims patients died or
OL,10,Fwere harmed during surgery.
OL,12,FNorthern Care Alliance (NCA), which
OL,13,Fruns four hospitals in Greater
OL,14,FManchester, including Salford Royal
OL,15,FHospital, was put under an NHS
OL,16,Fenforcement notice to improve patient
OL,17,Fsafety, in June.
OL,19,FBut whistle blowers have now told an
OL,20,Finvestigation by the Independent and
OL,21,FChannel 4, external that they were
OL,22,Fdiscouraged from reporting concerns.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
